      "id": "claim_2eeda17c42234c0298522ba48e96d6f8",
      "statement": "Brijio's runtime is a single explicit request/response chain: Agent -> MCP Server -> WebSocket Relay -> Browser Extension -> Browser Session. The browser remains the source of truth; agents receive no cloned browser or continuously streamed view.",
      "evidence": [
