      "id": "claim_bcca83adec2c4fcf85504d94d0791cd1",
      "statement": "The shared package owns the canonical protocol and browser-agnostic logic. packages/shared/src/index.ts re-exports the shared modules and packages/shared/src/protocol.ts defines the WebSocket envelope, auth and presence messages, browser capability names, tab-listing shapes, and request/response payload types used by both server-side code and extensions.",
      "evidence": [
