      "id": "claim_0fe36e777e7d4673897a97a0d8a67da4",
      "statement": "Change ownership by layer: protocol and data shapes belong in packages/shared; routing and authentication in servers/websocket; agent-facing tools/resources/skills in servers/mcp; browser capability in the extensions plus shared adapters. Cross-layer changes should follow the path shared protocol -> WebSocket relay -> MCP surface -> shared controller -> Chrome adapter -> Safari adapter -> integration tests.",
